  "result": "Perfect! All 310 tests pass. I've added the `lateFee` function to `src/reports.js` with comprehensive tests.\n\n## Summary\n\nAdded `lateFee(invoice, asOf)` to `src/reports.js` that:\n- Calculates 0.04% per day overdue on the amount still due\n- Returns 0 if:\n  - Invoice is null or missing dueDate\n  - Invoice is not overdue (dueDate >= asOf)\n  - Invoice is fully paid (due = 0)\n- Formula: `lateFee = due \u00d7 0.0004 \u00d7 daysOverdue` (rounded to cents)\n\nAdded 22 tests in `test/reports.test.js` covering:\n- Null/missing inputs\n- Not overdue, on due date, and overdue scenarios\n- Various payment statuses (issued, partially_paid, paid, draft)\n- Fee scaling with days overdue (linear relationship)\n- Fee scaling with due amounts\n- Different payment terms (NET14, NET30, EOM)\n- Partial payments\n- Edge cases and formula verification\n\nAll 310 project tests pass.",
